# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MedLoop AI — Git ignore
#
# READ THIS BEFORE ADDING A RULE:
# `Dataset/` is intentionally part of this repository. Images are versioned
# through Git LFS (see .gitattributes), metadata.csv through normal Git.
# Never add a `Dataset/` ignore rule here. The only Dataset paths excluded are
# the macOS `.DS_Store` sidecar files caught by the OS section below.
#
# What this file exists to keep out: local runtime state, model weights,
# secrets, caches, build output, and any re-downloaded dataset archive.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── macOS / Windows / editor cruft ───────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Icon?
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# ── Secrets and local configuration ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Nothing that authenticates anything belongs in this repository.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.cer
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
*.jks
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
credentials.json
client_secret*.json
secrets.*
*.secrets

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.installed.cfg
.Python
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
.python-version
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.dmypy.json
.tox/
.nox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ── Node / Next.js ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
.yarn/
.next/
out/
.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
.eslintcache
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ── MedLoop AI local runtime root ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything the running system writes: one physical copy of each working
# image, Grad-CAM artefacts, model weights, batch manifests, logs.
# Configured by MEDLOOP_STORAGE_ROOT. See .claude/CLAUDE.md §3.2.
storage/

# ── Trained model artefacts (wherever they land) ─────────────────────────────
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.h5
*.tflite

# ── Databases and dumps ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.dump
*.sql.gz
*.bak

# ── Logs and local scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
tmp/
.tmp/
scratch/

# ── Archives ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Guard against committing a re-downloaded dataset archive
# (imgs_part_1.zip and friends) alongside the extracted images.
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.rar
*.7z
